(7136979, 1093516, 124190, '<td valign="top">I''m on my cellie....flat out on my back (too much Thanksgiving)- decided to cruise the thumbs of this free study.....this image popped out, caught my attention..... I''m not one for portraits all that often unless I take them...lolol.....but there is something in this that holds me....shows the viewer the way they relate....its as if she is looking in a mirror admiring him.....very intense....love the veins in her hand....so pulsing...alive... favorite portrait I''ve seen on d.p.c. ever. 10+<br/>Every part of this works.....you could even crop it into a matrix.... each....part would work....very strong!</td>', 'I''m on my cellie....flat out on my back (too much Thanksgiving)- decided to cruise the thumbs of this free study.....this image popped out, caught my attention..... I''m not one for portraits all that often unless I take them...lolol.....but there is something in this that holds me....shows the viewer the way they relate....its as if she is looking in a mirror admiring him.....very intense....love the veins in her hand....so pulsing...alive... favorite portrait I''ve seen on d.p.c. ever. 10+Every part of this works.....you could even crop it into a matrix.... each....part would work....very strong!', '2013-12-01 11:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
