(7137502, 1093172, 41337, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice but to give it that professional touch you should retouch the dress a bit. The parts that are hanging / drooping take something away from the overall elegance.</td>', 'The lighting is nice but to give it that professional touch you should retouch the dress a bit. The parts that are hanging / drooping take something away from the overall elegance.', '2013-12-02 00:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137571, 1093716, 172707, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Ciiiiiigarettes cigars cigarrs it''s gonna be a hot hot ho-t ho-t ho-t...... You''ve captured their characters perfectly, and the colours are great!  I suppose I''m not allowed to vote either Mary Ann am I?! ;-)</td>', 'Brilliant! Ciiiiiigarettes cigars cigarrs it''s gonna be a hot hot ho-t ho-t ho-t...... You''ve captured their characters perfectly, and the colours are great!  I suppose I''m not allowed to vote either Mary Ann am I?! ;-)', '2013-12-02 04:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137595, 1093153, 30364, '<td valign="top">Yes, scent visualised.  Vapours slanting, wafting with the promise of some tantalising Grail.  You even give us a glimpse of the molecular diagram of the scent, at the top left corner.  It''s a fragrant <i>tour de force</i>  Thank you.</td>', 'Yes, scent visualised.  Vapours slanting, wafting with the promise of some tantalising Grail.  You even give us a glimpse of the molecular diagram of the scent, at the top left corner.  It''s a fragrant tour de force  Thank you.', '2013-12-02 05:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137596, 1092535, 30364, '<td valign="top">All these wonderful things: small faces, smears, hieroglyphs, umbrella and rain ... and yet it''s just a simple hand-on-hip that connects all the dots and makes street pantomime.  Thank you.</td>', 'All these wonderful things: small faces, smears, hieroglyphs, umbrella and rain ... and yet it''s just a simple hand-on-hip that connects all the dots and makes street pantomime.  Thank you.', '2013-12-02 05:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137597, 1093727, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting what a difference a happy chance (you may call it a decisive moment, and I won''t argue) makes.  If even a single face in the background were not turned uniformly away, the glass would crack and the picture would be flawed. Masterfully understated photograph with genuine substance.  Thank you.</td>', 'Interesting what a difference a happy chance (you may call it a decisive moment, and I won''t argue) makes.  If even a single face in the background were not turned uniformly away, the glass would crack and the picture would be flawed. Masterfully understated photograph with genuine substance.  Thank you.', '2013-12-02 05:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137599, 1093741, 30364, '<td valign="top">Could not fail to acknowledge this, because it''s so interesting.  I think you''ve photographed a bit of wall art?  But if that''s what you''ve done you''ve given it wings.  If that''s not what you did at all, I don''t care and I still thank you.</td>', 'Could not fail to acknowledge this, because it''s so interesting.  I think you''ve photographed a bit of wall art?  But if that''s what you''ve done you''ve given it wings.  If that''s not what you did at all, I don''t care and I still thank you.', '2013-12-02 05:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137602, 1093796, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a lot more interesting than first glance promised.  Such a beautiful offhand orchestration of shapes, tone and colour.  Most of us wouldn''t even see this; it''s a lesson to us in seeing.  A photograph that repays a longer look. Several, in fact. Thank you.</td>', 'This is a lot more interesting than first glance promised.  Such a beautiful offhand orchestration of shapes, tone and colour.  Most of us wouldn''t even see this; it''s a lesson to us in seeing.  A photograph that repays a longer look. Several, in fact. Thank you.', '2013-12-02 06:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137608, 1090137, 30364, '<td valign="top">This genre of low-fidelity photographs (my favourite genre) is so difficult to execute well.  This picture is a fabulous lesson in the difference between the genuine article - which this is - and the faux stuff.  Many will dismiss it without thought and thus deny themselves the opportunity to marvel at the beautiful composition, so elegantly apt, and the masterful ordering of the graphic blocks from which the picture is built.  Will fail as well to grasp that the eloquence of the picture derives from what is withheld.  Other than the title of course, because that''s heartbreakingly meaningful.  Thank you.</td>', 'This genre of low-fidelity photographs (my favourite genre) is so difficult to execute well.  This picture is a fabulous lesson in the difference between the genuine article - which this is - and the faux stuff.  Many will dismiss it without thought and thus deny themselves the opportunity to marvel at the beautiful composition, so elegantly apt, and the masterful ordering of the graphic blocks from which the picture is built.  Will fail as well to grasp that the eloquence of the picture derives from what is withheld.  Other than the title of course, because that''s heartbreakingly meaningful.  Thank you.', '2013-12-02 06:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137609, 1093344, 30364, '<td valign="top">Huge assurance and confidence in this work.  Whoever you may be, you''re an artist first.  Thank you.</td>', 'Huge assurance and confidence in this work.  Whoever you may be, you''re an artist first.  Thank you.', '2013-12-02 06:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137610, 1093685, 30364, '<td valign="top">Goodness me, a snapshot that transcends the glass ceiling!  It''s a real photograph.  I mean that, in case you doubt, as a very big compliment.  Anyone can make a photograph out of ''photography'' but very few can make a photograph out of a single heartbeat. Thank you.</td>', 'Goodness me, a snapshot that transcends the glass ceiling!  It''s a real photograph.  I mean that, in case you doubt, as a very big compliment.  Anyone can make a photograph out of ''photography'' but very few can make a photograph out of a single heartbeat. Thank you.', '2013-12-02 06:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7137613, 1093587, 30364, '<td valign="top">Outstandingly charming photograph.  Greatest among its many charms is its combination of conceptual assurance with candour.  You''ve breathed softly on a moment and made a delight.  Thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-10-01 05:00:04.</i></td>', 'Outstandingly charming photograph.  Greatest among its many charms is its combination of conceptual assurance with candour.  You''ve breathed softly on a moment and made a delight.  Thank you.', '2013-12-02 06:40:55.000000', '2014-10-01 06:00:04.000000', 1),
(7137615, 1093446, 30364, '<td valign="top">I simply love this anti-photography photograph.  It''s a photograph about a photograph which is itself about the nature of the photograph.  It''s a Droste effect for grown ups.  It''s my top pick in the challenge.  10 and thank you.</td>', 'I simply love this anti-photography photograph.  It''s a photograph about a photograph which is itself about the nature of the photograph.  It''s a Droste effect for grown ups.  It''s my top pick in the challenge.  10 and thank you.', '2013-12-02 06:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
