(7137691, 1093843, 124190, '<td valign="top">ahhhhhhhhhhhhh.............this title reminds me of the types of books my mother would have me read    there''s a name for that....I can''t remember what it is.....  probably because it made me anxious and I ended up sitting in the middle of a staircase somewhere wishing I was outside instead of researching the literature she had me read.....there were ALWAYS at least a dozen books by her side when she was reading.....as you needed a library to understand what was going on....became a life long pattern....<br/> <br/>  or this makes me flash to clinging to the underside of my bed lifting my body up against the frame so they wouldn''t find me......   oh my...... high mark for provoking and overcoming that which I do not understand   and will be ok with   unless of course you chose to explain...which would be interesting..... ah sh_t....now I HAVE to research what you''ve offered....Much fun......<br/> <br/>//www.compactappliance.com/FIM44-Franklin-Undercounter-Built-In-Clear-Ice-Maker/FIM44.html<br/>Na.....that isnt it.....<br/> <br/>or is it more like this?<br/> <br/>https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTuEXWFAfNIZiiFO7w63SxCOKf6KLaMYoupC41RVmG2DXHWxPYTxw<br/>NOOOOOOOOOOO.....right?     no<br/> <br/> <br/>WAIT   I think I found something! //vnylst.tumblr.com/post/64816034854<br/> <br/> <br/>I better stop...I guess.    Ug PLEASE comment after the challenge....this was great..... got my brain fired up......again</td>', 'ahhhhhhhhhhhhh.............this title reminds me of the types of books my mother would have me read    there''s a name for that....I can''t remember what it is.....  probably because it made me anxious and I ended up sitting in the middle of a staircase somewhere wishing I was outside instead of researching the literature she had me read.....there were ALWAYS at least a dozen books by her side when she was reading.....as you needed a library to understand what was going on....became a life long pattern....   or this makes me flash to clinging to the underside of my bed lifting my body up against the frame so they wouldn''t find me......   oh my...... high mark for provoking and overcoming that which I do not understand   and will be ok with   unless of course you chose to explain...which would be interesting..... ah sh_t....now I HAVE to research what you''ve offered....Much fun...... //www.compactappliance.com/FIM44-Franklin-Undercounter-Built-In-Clear-Ice-Maker/FIM44.htmlNa.....that isnt it..... or is it more like this? https://encrypted-tbn2.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTuEXWFAfNIZiiFO7w63SxCOKf6KLaMYoupC41RVmG2DXHWxPYTxwNOOOOOOOOOOO.....right?     no  WAIT   I think I found something! //vnylst.tumblr.com/post/64816034854  I better stop...I guess.    Ug PLEASE comment after the challenge....this was great..... got my brain fired up......again', '2013-12-02 09:54:59.000000', NULL, 1);
