(7137709, 1093570, 124190, '<td valign="top">it''s definitely a challenge to photograph sound/movement/expression....this looks like the beginning of a workshop shot where I would LOVE to see something in the dark areas.......patterns......light streaks....something that would support the theme....  do you know what I mean?  maybe an overlay of some sort with a blur of the arm movements....head thrown back.... strings splitting and flying in a plucked moment<br/> <br/>I respect your premise - and I offer as a compliment to your effort.....</td>', 'it''s definitely a challenge to photograph sound/movement/expression....this looks like the beginning of a workshop shot where I would LOVE to see something in the dark areas.......patterns......light streaks....something that would support the theme....  do you know what I mean?  maybe an overlay of some sort with a blur of the arm movements....head thrown back.... strings splitting and flying in a plucked moment I respect your premise - and I offer as a compliment to your effort.....', '2013-12-02 10:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
