(7138944, 1093528, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the colors of the trolly contrasted with the station. Love the choice of the night shot - the lights inside the trolly are really cool. I love that you had enough aperture/depth of field to get the trolly and the station in crisp focus. I would have been tempted to burn out the tree, telephone poles and telephone line in post processing.</td>', 'Love the colors of the trolly contrasted with the station. Love the choice of the night shot - the lights inside the trolly are really cool. I love that you had enough aperture/depth of field to get the trolly and the station in crisp focus. I would have been tempted to burn out the tree, telephone poles and telephone line in post processing.', '2013-12-04 19:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
