(7139399, 1091044, 83313, '<td valign="top">Females in tribe of Grog are taut growing of plants at early age. In this pikchur, female is seen talking to plant to make grow big and strong. Iz posituv motivashun. Tells plant how wonderful and green plant is and how delishus leaves are. Is important skill to raise yummy  and <strike>nutrishus</strike> <strike>newtrishis</strike> <strike>nuttrichus</strike> helthy plants bekause hunting party not always bring back mammoth, bear, or even bag of skinny skwurrils.</td>', 'Females in tribe of Grog are taut growing of plants at early age. In this pikchur, female is seen talking to plant to make grow big and strong. Iz posituv motivashun. Tells plant how wonderful and green plant is and how delishus leaves are. Is important skill to raise yummy  and nutrishus newtrishis nuttrichus helthy plants bekause hunting party not always bring back mammoth, bear, or even bag of skinny skwurrils.', '2013-12-05 20:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7139402, 1093549, 83313, '<td valign="top">Shhhh!! Be very, very kwyet. Grog hunting humvees. Not good eating for tribe, but head look grate hanging on cave wall. Much bragging right.</td>', 'Shhhh!! Be very, very kwyet. Grog hunting humvees. Not good eating for tribe, but head look grate hanging on cave wall. Much bragging right.', '2013-12-05 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7139403, 1093843, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice semi-abstract. Has a bit of a look like an Escher painting.</td>', 'Nice semi-abstract. Has a bit of a look like an Escher painting.', '2013-12-05 20:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
