(7139995, 1093607, 60047, '<td valign="top">Really quite a beautiful shot.</td>', 'Really quite a beautiful shot.', '2013-12-07 18:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7139998, 1093347, 102278, '<td valign="top">This is just stunning. In every sense of the word. 11, well, 10 then. There is a technical thing to this though, of course. I''m quite interested in the geeky technical stuff. This looks kind of like it is shot with a Leica and one of those fast 50mm lenses. It had that feel. I''m curious as to what you''ve shot it with. Anyway, tech stuff apart - it''s a lovely human portrait at the end of the day. Nothing else needed.</td>', 'This is just stunning. In every sense of the word. 11, well, 10 then. There is a technical thing to this though, of course. I''m quite interested in the geeky technical stuff. This looks kind of like it is shot with a Leica and one of those fast 50mm lenses. It had that feel. I''m curious as to what you''ve shot it with. Anyway, tech stuff apart - it''s a lovely human portrait at the end of the day. Nothing else needed.', '2013-12-07 18:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7139999, 1090137, 102278, '<td valign="top">This gets my other 10. What a beautiful comparison to my other 10. This melts away, drags up memories and holds them up in front of my eyes. Utterly great. 10.</td>', 'This gets my other 10. What a beautiful comparison to my other 10. This melts away, drags up memories and holds them up in front of my eyes. Utterly great. 10.', '2013-12-07 19:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7140001, 1093637, 102278, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Even the high contrast processing. 6</td>', 'I really like this. Even the high contrast processing. 6', '2013-12-07 19:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7140002, 1093633, 102278, '<td valign="top">Arrgh!. I like these things.</td>', 'Arrgh!. I like these things.', '2013-12-07 19:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7140003, 1092999, 102278, '<td valign="top">Hum, i don''t know about this sort of stuff. It is so contrived and, really, doesn''t say much at all. Technically it is fine i guess, but, really, it''s not much of a photograph and isn''t really saying much creatively. 5.</td>', 'Hum, i don''t know about this sort of stuff. It is so contrived and, really, doesn''t say much at all. Technically it is fine i guess, but, really, it''s not much of a photograph and isn''t really saying much creatively. 5.', '2013-12-07 19:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
