(7140272, 1093873, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by beatabg:</b></div><hr/><i> Super nice portrait. Love it. Cool eyes and processing. The white stuff behind him is bugging me a little, but I still think it''s a great portrait. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the white thing bugged me as well, but hey i thought no one would notice, hehe! Thanks for the comment anyway!</td>', 'Originally posted by beatabg: Super nice portrait. Love it. Cool eyes and processing. The white stuff behind him is bugging me a little, but I still think it''s a great portrait.   the white thing bugged me as well, but hey i thought no one would notice, hehe! Thanks for the comment anyway!', '2013-12-08 00:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
