(7140295, 1093741, 63218, '<td valign="top">I went looking for this after voting. Hoping you had notes. Curious. Thank you! My mind tried desperately to find something to recognize in this &amp; failed completely. Beauty is probably there all the time in the most everyday objects, we just don''t see it. Glad you captured this one &amp; even more that you entered it. Thanks again.</td>', 'I went looking for this after voting. Hoping you had notes. Curious. Thank you! My mind tried desperately to find something to recognize in this & failed completely. Beauty is probably there all the time in the most everyday objects, we just don''t see it. Glad you captured this one & even more that you entered it. Thanks again.', '2013-12-08 00:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
