(7140357, 1093516, 128323, '<td valign="top">I love the negative space to the viewer''s right, but I think it probably cost you a few points here and there, due to the fact that most viewers cant appreciate most of the details in this amazing shot due to the 800 px limit.  This is a wonderful portrait, and it would have been a 9 or 10 from me.  The tonality is superb!</td>', 'I love the negative space to the viewer''s right, but I think it probably cost you a few points here and there, due to the fact that most viewers cant appreciate most of the details in this amazing shot due to the 800 px limit.  This is a wonderful portrait, and it would have been a 9 or 10 from me.  The tonality is superb!', '2013-12-08 02:08:17.000000', NULL, 0),
