(7140386, 1091734, 54446, '<td valign="top">Masterful composition!  The snowy environment adds drama.  Ideal saturatiion.  Wonderful detail, especially the eye catch glint.  Congrats on your Red ribbon for the "redbird".  Cardinals do not prefer the coniferous forests of the Colorado mountains.  I miss them.  Am enjoying yours immensely.</td>', 'Masterful composition!  The snowy environment adds drama.  Ideal saturatiion.  Wonderful detail, especially the eye catch glint.  Congrats on your Red ribbon for the "redbird".  Cardinals do not prefer the coniferous forests of the Colorado mountains.  I miss them.  Am enjoying yours immensely.', '2013-12-08 05:35:52.000000', NULL, 0),
