(7140491, 1091734, 30049, '<td valign="top">Robert - I really enjoyed this photo.  Well deserved placement in the end results.  I like how you have the birds attention, but not so invasive that it''s going to spook (although it''s probably relatively "warm" and didn''t want to move unless it had to).  :-)  I gave it a 9, the only thing holding back the 10 was the signature of man in the photo (the fence post and slats).</td>', 'Robert - I really enjoyed this photo.  Well deserved placement in the end results.  I like how you have the birds attention, but not so invasive that it''s going to spook (although it''s probably relatively "warm" and didn''t want to move unless it had to).  :-)  I gave it a 9, the only thing holding back the 10 was the signature of man in the photo (the fence post and slats).', '2013-12-08 11:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
