(7140545, 1091734, 108580, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Robert. I can only imagine how you feel; a FS ribbon with a bird! Lovely image with a high capture difficulty. Postcard pretty and all the right flavours for this time of year, red and snow. From what I gather a typically iconic American bird. Had I had a chance to vote in this FS I''d have awarded a 9. My assessment concurs with jjstager2 and glad2badad.<br/> <br/>Cherish it!</td>', 'Congratulations Robert. I can only imagine how you feel; a FS ribbon with a bird! Lovely image with a high capture difficulty. Postcard pretty and all the right flavours for this time of year, red and snow. From what I gather a typically iconic American bird. Had I had a chance to vote in this FS I''d have awarded a 9. My assessment concurs with jjstager2 and glad2badad. Cherish it!', '2013-12-08 14:39:55.000000', NULL, 0),
