(7141013, 1093568, 116247, '<td valign="top">Great sign and I like how you processed this. I would have cropped out the bottom left corner and I would have eliminated the black border. whe I first looked at the car I didn''t like the roof but the more I look at it the more it fits the image.</td>', 'Great sign and I like how you processed this. I would have cropped out the bottom left corner and I would have eliminated the black border. whe I first looked at the car I didn''t like the roof but the more I look at it the more it fits the image.', '2013-12-09 21:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
