(7141124, 1093347, 144365, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cutout:</b></div><hr/><i> now seriously<br/>how many of the commentators would hang this on their wall?<br/>be honest </i></td></tr></table>I would. It''s my style of photography though.<br/>The other ribbon winners on the front page right now wouldn''t have a chance of making it on my wall though. I''ve always loved uncontrived portraiture of interesting people.<br/> <br/>Sorry hotpasta, thought I would respond here since I can''t in the forums.</td>', 'Originally posted by cutout: now seriouslyhow many of the commentators would hang this on their wall?be honest I would. It''s my style of photography though.The other ribbon winners on the front page right now wouldn''t have a chance of making it on my wall though. I''ve always loved uncontrived portraiture of interesting people. Sorry hotpasta, thought I would respond here since I can''t in the forums.', '2013-12-10 10:04:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(7141127, 1093347, 74588, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Venser:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cutout:</b></div><hr/><i> now seriously<br/>how many of the commentators would hang this on their wall?<br/>be honest </i></td></tr></table>I would. It''s my style of photography though.<br/>The other ribbon winners on the front page right now wouldn''t have a chance of making it on my wall though. I''ve always loved uncontrived portraiture of interesting people.<br/> <br/>Sorry hotpasta, thought I would respond here since I can''t in the forums. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>i like that oh btw i gave this a 7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-12-10 10:12:21.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Venser: Originally posted by cutout: now seriouslyhow many of the commentators would hang this on their wall?be honest I would. It''s my style of photography though.The other ribbon winners on the front page right now wouldn''t have a chance of making it on my wall though. I''ve always loved uncontrived portraiture of interesting people. Sorry hotpasta, thought I would respond here since I can''t in the forums.  i like that oh btw i gave this a 7', '2013-12-10 10:08:27.000000', '2013-12-10 10:12:21.000000', 0),
