(7142403, 1093516, 65319, '<td valign="top">Oh this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=27133" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Judi</a> masterpiece!  My apologies.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=87808" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">JulietNN</a> always has fascinating and rather dramatic models posed in harrowing ways...like you have here which is why I thought this one was hers.  I am curious what this looks like in color.  I picture his tattoos in color and her hair a light shade of golden red.  Anyways...10 from me...;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-12-13 17:59:55.</i></td>', 'Oh this is a  Judi masterpiece!  My apologies.   JulietNN always has fascinating and rather dramatic models posed in harrowing ways...like you have here which is why I thought this one was hers.  I am curious what this looks like in color.  I picture his tattoos in color and her hair a light shade of golden red.  Anyways...10 from me...;-)', '2013-12-13 17:59:04.000000', '2013-12-13 17:59:55.000000', 0),
